WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.680
Tap a track to play it.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.080
Cadance changes tempo, not pitch.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.860
Tap slower or faster: 2% a tap.

4
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.450
Drag across the arrows for faster changes.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.370
Hear it? Much slower, and still in tune.

6
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.750
Tap the percentage to return to normal.

7
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.450
Or speed up, as far as +100%.

8
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.650
On tracks you own, tempo changes never interrupt the music.

9
00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:40.650
Tracks you own have no icon. Apple Music tracks show a cloud, or a waveform once downloaded.

10
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:42.790
Apple Music tracks work too.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.330
Each change pauses them briefly. That's an Apple limitation.
